{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00455","headline":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 青帝角音 雍和 · 魏徵","name":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 青帝角音 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大乐稀音，至诚简礼。\n文物棣棣，声明济济。\n六变有成，三登无体。\n乃眷丰洁，恩覃恺悌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}